alid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1619,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[992,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1883,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1820,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1859,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1829,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[723,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1449,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1446,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1455,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1456,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1444,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1450,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1453,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1447,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1459,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[206,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[2084,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2086,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2080,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[2082,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[2087,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[2083,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[2081,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[2085,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[2037,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[605,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1656,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1179,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1304,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[406,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[299,"`aria-disabled` for disabled check